UNIT_ID: U-015
NAME: Implementation—Evaluation Loop Forced by Chat Interface
LENS: LENS_ARTIFACT
TYPE: process_constraint
STATUS: SOURCE_SUPPORTED
FUNCTION: Krytyka wymuszonej częstej zmiany trybu implement/evaluate w czacie: użytkownik pyta (implement), czyta odpowiedź (evaluate); wait for response niszczy flow state; analogia do lengthy compile loop w programowaniu.
MINIMAL_FORM:
  - painter: up close (smooshing paint) vs stepping back (evaluate and plan)
  - chatbot: ask question (implement) → read response (evaluate) → ask next question
  - no flow state if stopping every few seconds; wait time is negative factor
  - good tools let user choose when to switch between implementation and evaluation
