UNIT_ID: U-021
NAME: Language Models as Multiverse Generators; Branching as Power Multiplier
LENS: LENS_SYSTEM, LENS_KNOWLEDGE
TYPE: design_principle
STATUS: SOURCE_SUPPORTED
FUNCTION: Teza: LLM są multiverse generators (distribution of possible continuations); interfejsy single-history (AI Dungeon) tracą potencjał; branching jest power multiplier dla cowriting (fiction i nonfiction: brainstorming, prototyping prompts).
MINIMAL_FORM:
  - at each generation step: distribution over next tokens; tree of possibilities branches out
  - single-history interface (AI Dungeon): only one variation saved; duplicating adventure leads to confusing profusion
  - branching allows exploring counterfactuals which can be merged into main (single-history works) or kept as multiple timelines (multi-history)
  - useful for nonfiction: brainstorming, prototyping prompts
